cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ERV Design Model: A Design-Forward Research Programme on Endogenous Retroviruses"
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: James
    name-particle: D.
    family-names: Longmire
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-1383-7698"
    email: jdlongmire@outlook.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/jdlongmire/erv-design-model"
abstract: >-
  A public research programme on endogenous retroviruses (ERVs) and ERV-like
  genomic elements. The programme is design-forward: it begins with the
  explanatory plausibility of design, critically interrogates the causal
  sufficiency and historical assumptions of consensus explanations, and
  evaluates competing accounts on demonstrated explanatory reach, predictive
  performance on tests registered in advance, and independently justified
  assumptions. It holds itself to dated preregistered predictions and records
  its failures in the open.
keywords:
  - endogenous retroviruses
  - ERV
  - design model
  - research programmes
  - Lakatos
  - comparative genomics
  - common descent
  - preregistration
